body:
> Just conceptually, it seems that this should:
> 1. not be a runtime check, but something known statically based on the method
> 2. be determined by the GDExtension API itself and not the caller

I agree that would be better, but not sure how to do it. For C#, I only care about `gdextension_object_method_bind_call` and I see that in this case we could use `mb->has_return()` instead:

```diff
Variant ret = mb->call(o, args, p_arg_count, error);
- if (r_return != nullptr) {
+ if (mb->has_return()) {
    memnew_placement(r_return, Variant(ret));
}
```

Would this be better? What should I do with the other methods?
